        <p>The estimate is the contract for the work. It lists the hours, what you'll get in plain English, the timeline, and the total. Once you approve it, you pay through the hourly checkout (or by ACH bank transfer if you prefer), and the work begins.</p>

        <ul class="contact-info-list" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
