              <p style="font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.6">A custom calculator. A booking system from another company (Calendly, Acuity, Square Appointments). An email-marketing template that matches your brand. A move from another website platform. A custom interactive page beyond the standard layouts. A connection to the trade software your business already uses.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="contact-info-item">
            <span class="icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></span>
            <div>
              <h3>How soon you get the estimate</h3>
