          <li>Live shingle photos, or a product picker beyond a text-and-color selector.</li>
          <li>A connection to a live materials-pricing feed. You maintain the pricing tiers.</li>
          <li>A/B testing or analytics dashboards beyond the existing visitor statistics.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

