      <section class="estimate-doc-section">
        <h3 class="estimate-doc-h">6. Payment terms</h3>
        <ul class="estimate-doc-terms">
          <li>The total is due in advance when you approve this estimate, through the online checkout (card or ACH bank transfer).</li>
